+### Durable authoring turn delivery
+
+`WorldAgentRunner` separates HTTP message acknowledgement from the existing native Macrofold run. Session-bound turns persist original input, sequence and terminal reply; same-origin exact/paged turn reads recover results without new inference. Exact-turn cancellation revokes the context before signalling its executor. Four in-process slots bound admission/execution, and server close/gameplay load drain them before repository shutdown. Restart uses existing uncertain-work recovery, never automatic redispatch. The shared UI integration remains separately tracked by INV-21.4. See [the runtime contract](world-agent-runtime.md#durable-turn-delivery) and [evidence](verification.md#durable-authoring-turn-delivery).
